    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Code vs described order",
      "items": [
        "sports_run.py calls sports_engine.run, not execute_allocations; it has its own sizing and category gate (sports_engine.py:455-467)",
        "Dynamic cap and half-Kelly run in allocate() (step 4) before execute_allocations, not after the clocks (master_allocator.py:371-381)",
        "kalshi_fee is not a standalone gate: allocator uses fee map + kalshi_profit EV; kalshi_fee books entry_fee and sizes sports"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fail-open vs fail-closed",
      "items": [
        "Fail-open: strategy pause, category gate (errors allow)",
        "Fail-closed: intel vetting, EV pre-flight, clocks, informed pre-flight, create_order re-check",
        "Bare POST ack is UNRECONCILED, never a live open (master_allocator.py:623-638)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Offline side",
      "items": [
        "Pause registry is written only from fee-true category_stats; fee-blind P&L is report-only (pnl_tracker.py:237-276)",
        "backtest_gate reads the ledger, writes nothing, no orders (backtest_gate.py:8-9); min-n hard floor 30 (:43); ship rule is documented, not enforced in code",
        "Runtime ledger is ~/.openclaw/workspace/models (forward_test_ledger.py:24); backtest_gate defaults to repo models/ (backtest_gate.py:41)"
      ]
    }
  ]
